	Priority: "100",
	ClearQueueOnFinish: "true",
	ToolTip: ["Combat Hazards|Push and Pull", "As you can see, it's important to pay attention to any potential hazards when positioning your units.|Some abilities are able to 'Push' or 'Pull' targets. By forcing targets into obstacles and terrain, you can inflict bonus damage and other harmful effects.\n\nMove the Pugilist into position and use his 'Crescent Wave' ability to push the enemy into the pit."],
